About two hours ago, the hacker returned 90% of the stolen funds to the Texture SOL address, taking the 10% greyhat bounty proposed earlier by the Texture team.

As the hacker has fulfilled their side of the agreement, we will not pursue the matter further.

We want to thank everyone who supported us throughout the incident — especially 
@wmt_ventures
 @FrankResearcher
 , who played a key role in situation management and negotiation tactics (incredible backers), 
@marygooneratne
 for sharing her experience with a similar issue and providing invaluable support and 
@lucasp3tr
 and 
@vibes8760
 for support.

We’re currently finalizing the code fix and completing a thorough review with our auditor. The updated contract will be redeployed shortly. Post-mortem is coming soon.

We truly appreciate your patience and understanding — and are grateful for the incredible spirit of camaraderie in the Solana ecosystem. 
